Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.34,0:00:29.71,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Жоқ деп ойлаңыз.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.84,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Енді ешқашан...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:30.75,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Ешқашан қайталанбасын
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:35.15,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Is Aoyama ready to go home?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.67,0:00:32.47,Default,Sorata,0,0,0,,How are things going for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.97,0:00:35.51,Default,Sorata,0,0,0,,Are you packed and ready to head home?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.51,0:00:36.30,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Оқу, оқу
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.30,0:00:37.22,Default,Sorata,0,0,0,,That's all you're bringing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:37.63,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Барлығы осы ма?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:41.14,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll be back again soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.68,0:00:41.10,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,I don't plan on being gone for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:47.48,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't want to give up
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.90,0:00:47.56,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,I don't want to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:52.87,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,My feelings are much stronger than before.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.48,0:00:52.69,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Right now, I feel more strongly about it than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.91,0:00:53.92,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Иә
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:56.46,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Feelings of wanting to be a voice actor
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.11,0:00:56.53,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,I want to become a voice actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.53,0:00:57.94,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Аояма
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.53,0:00:58.07,Default,Sorata,0,0,0,,Аояма.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:01:00.30,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,You should go back to Osaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.07,0:00:59.91,Default,Chihiro,0,0,0,,Осакаға оралыңыз.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.95,0:01:03.12,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Чихиро-сенсей?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:01.72,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Чихиро Сенсей
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.45,0:01:03.12,Alternative,Chihiro,0,0,0,,A bit of this, and a bit of that...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.70,0:01:07.08,Default,Chihiro,0,0,0,,Go back and change your parents' minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:07.42,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Ата-анаңызды дұрыс сендіруді ұмытпаңыз.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.33,0:01:12.49,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,I guess you've been doing it alone for the past two years.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.38,0:01:12.26,Default,Chihiro,0,0,0,,Мен сіз соңғы екі жылда өзін-өзі қамтамасыз етуге тырысқаныңызды білемін,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.26,0:01:15.51,Default,Chihiro,0,0,0,,but if you think doing all your deliberation and decision-making alone makes you an adult,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:16.04,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Бәрін өзің ойла, өзің шеш
