Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.02,0:01:25.97,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Бұл тек балалар жасайтын нәрсе емес
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.64,0:01:27.02,Default,Sorata,0,0,0,,Енді тұр, Сенсей.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.02,0:01:26.96,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey Sensei
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:27.61,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Бұлай айту тым көп
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.02,0:01:27.85,Default,Sorata,0,0,0,,Бұл сәл қатал-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:29.21,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay, Kanda-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.85,0:01:29.19,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Жарайды, Канда-кун.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.19,0:01:31.11,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Ол дұрыс.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:30.75,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.79,0:01:34.11,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Сол кезде әкем маған қарсы болды.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.11,0:01:34.07,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Back then, when my father opposed my decision,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.07,0:01:36.61,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Мен оңай жолды таңдадым деп ойлаймын.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.15,0:01:36.13,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Мен жеңілін таңдадым деп ойлаймын.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:39.64,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Complaining about things that don't get your point across
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.61,0:01:39.62,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Throwing a fit because I wasn't getting my way
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.62,0:01:41.78,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,және үйден қашу.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:41.62,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Жаңа ғана үйден қашып кетті
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.52,0:01:45.98,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Мен қайтып келіп, сенімен сөйлесемін.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.62,0:01:45.37,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,I'm going to go back and talk it over with them.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.87,0:01:48.62,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,I'll ask them to let me keep pursuing my dream
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.06,0:01:48.29,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Маған армандарымды жалғастыруға рұқсат етіңіз.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.38,0:01:51.17,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Маған Сакурасуда қалуға рұқсат етіңіз.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.62,0:01:50.92,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,және маған Сакура-суда қалуға рұқсат етіңіз.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.92,0:01:52.34,Default,Chihiro,0,0,0,,You do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.22,0:01:52.25,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Иә, иә
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:57.07,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Осыны айтайын.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.26,0:01:57.68,Default,Chihiro,0,0,0,,Мен сізге бір нәрсені айтайын:
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.68,0:02:01.01,Default,Chihiro,0,0,0,,Екі жылыңыз текке кеткен жоқ.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:02:01.46,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Екі жылыңыз текке кеткен жоқ.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.89,0:02:03.11,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Мүлдем
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.93,0:02:03.35,Default,Chihiro,0,0,0,,I guarantee you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.15,0:02:13.32,Default,Sorata,0,0,0,,All said, she can sound like a teacher when she wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:13.32,*Default-ja,NTP,0,0,0,,Because that person sometimes says things like a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:10.44,SPK-TS,,0,0,0,,Suimei University of the Arts' Senior High Dormitory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:10.56,SPK-TS,,0,0,0,,Suimei University of the Arts' Senior High Dormitory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:10.69,SPK-TS,,0,0,0,,Suimei University of the Arts' Senior High Dormitory
