Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.52,0:21:00.98,Default,Maid-chan,0,0,0,,Мен сізге вирус жіберемін. (lol)
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.98,0:21:03.53,Default,Misaki,0,0,0,,Junior's on Mashiro Duty!
